{"seq":1,"slug":"function-calling","title":"Function Calling 机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/tool-integration/function-calling","wordCount":872,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"function-calling-机制\">Function Calling 机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Function Calling 是 LLM 与外部系统交互的标准化接口：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开发者向 LLM 描述一组可调用的函数</li>\n<li>LLM 根据用户请求自主决定调用哪个函数以及传入什么参数</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"意图-执行分离\">意图-执行分离</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LLM</td>\n<td>输出结构化的调用意图（不执行）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用层</td>\n<td>负责实际执行函数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「意图-执行分离」的设计是构建安全可控 Agent 系统的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[用户请求]--&gt;B[LLM 推理]&#10;    B--&gt;|生成调用意图|C[Call JSON]&#10;    C--&gt;D[应用层执行]&#10;    D--&gt;|执行结果|E[LLM 整合]&#10;    E--&gt;F[最终回答]\">flowchart TD\n    A[用户请求]--&gt;B[LLM 推理]\n    B--&gt;|生成调用意图|C[Call JSON]\n    C--&gt;D[应用层执行]\n    D--&gt;|执行结果|E[LLM 整合]\n    E--&gt;F[最终回答]</pre><h3 id=\"各家提供商能力对比\">各家提供商能力对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型提供商</th>\n<th>接口名称</th>\n<th>并行调用</th>\n<th>强制调用</th>\n<th>结构化输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OpenAI</td>\n<td>Function Calling / Tools</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>tool_choice</td>\n<td>JSON Schema</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Anthropic</td>\n<td>Tool Use</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>tool_choice</td>\n<td>JSON Schema</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google</td>\n<td>Function Calling</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>function_calling_config</td>\n<td>JSON Schema</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ollama/本地</td>\n<td>部分支持</td>\n<td>视模型</td>\n<td>视模型</td>\n<td>视模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"openai-function-calling-实现\">OpenAI Function Calling 实现</h2><ul>\n<li>OpenAI 通过 <code>tools</code> 参数定义可用函数</li>\n<li>LLM 返回 <code>tool_calls</code> 字段表示调用意图</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"函数定义\">函数定义</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const tools = [&#10;  {&#10;    type: &#39;function&#39;,&#10;    function: {&#10;      name: &#39;get_stock_price&#39;,&#10;      description: &#39;股票实时价格&#39;,&#10;      parameters: {&#10;        type: &#39;object&#39;,&#10;        properties: {&#10;          symbol: strSchema,&#10;          market: marketEnum,&#10;        },&#10;        required: [&#39;symbol&#39;],&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'function'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    function: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'get_stock_price'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'股票实时价格'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      parameters: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'object'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        properties: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          symbol: strSchema,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          market: marketEnum,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        required: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'symbol'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"调用-反馈循环\">调用-反馈循环</h3><p>应用层在执行函数后将结果作为 <code>tool</code> 类型消息反馈给 LLM：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const res = await chat({&#10;  model: &#39;gpt-4-turbo&#39;,&#10;  messages,&#10;  tools,&#10;  tool_choice: &#39;auto&#39;,&#10;});&#10;for (const call of toolCallsOf(res)) {&#10;  messages.push({&#10;    role: &#39;tool&#39;,&#10;    tool_call_id: call.id,&#10;    content: await execute(call),&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> res</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> chat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  model: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-4-turbo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  messages,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tools,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tool_choice: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'auto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> call</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> toolCallsOf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(res)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  messages.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tool'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tool_call_id: call.id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    content: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(call),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"并行调用\">并行调用</h3><p>并行 Function Calling 是 OpenAI 的重要能力，大幅减少了多工具场景下的交互轮次：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LLM</td>\n<td>单次响应中返回多个 <code>tool_calls</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用层</td>\n<td>并行执行后统一反馈结果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"anthropic-tool-use-对比\">Anthropic Tool Use 对比</h2><ul>\n<li>Anthropic 的 Tool Use 接口在概念上与 OpenAI 类似，但在实现细节上有显著差异</li>\n<li>理解这些差异对于构建跨模型的 Agent 系统至关重要</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"接口形态\">接口形态</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"await anthropic.messages.create({&#10;  model: &#39;claude-3-sonnet-20240229&#39;,&#10;  max_tokens: 1024,&#10;  tools: [&#10;    {&#10;      name: &#39;search_database&#39;,&#10;      description: &#39;搜索匹配的商品&#39;,&#10;      input_schema: productSchema,&#10;    },&#10;  ],&#10;  messages,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> anthropic.messages.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  model: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'claude-3-sonnet-20240229'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  max_tokens: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tools: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'search_database'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'搜索匹配的商品'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      input_schema: productSchema,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  messages,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>工具结果以 <code>tool_result</code> 内容块嵌在下一条 user 消息中回传（携带 <code>tool_use_id</code>）</li>\n<li>不是独立的 <code>tool</code> 角色消息</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"五个关键差异\">五个关键差异</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异点</th>\n<th>OpenAI</th>\n<th>Anthropic</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参数定义字段</td>\n<td><code>parameters</code></td>\n<td><code>input_schema</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调用结果角色</td>\n<td><code>role: &quot;tool&quot;</code></td>\n<td>嵌套在 user 消息中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强制调用</td>\n<td><code>tool_choice: { type: &quot;function&quot;, function: { name } }</code></td>\n<td><code>tool_choice: { type: &quot;tool&quot;, name }</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容块类型</td>\n<td><code>message.tool_calls</code> 数组</td>\n<td><code>content</code> 中 <code>tool_use</code> 块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>停止原因</td>\n<td><code>finish_reason: &quot;tool_calls&quot;</code></td>\n<td><code>stop_reason: &quot;tool_use&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"函数描述优化\">函数描述优化</h2><ul>\n<li>函数描述的质量直接决定了 LLM 的调用准确性</li>\n<li>优秀的描述应当清晰、具体、无歧义，并包含边界条件说明</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"高质量描述示例\">高质量描述示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"description: `创建 Jira 工单。&#10;使用场景：用户明确要求创建任务、Bug 或需求时调用。&#10;不要在用户只是讨论问题时调用。&#10;成功返回工单 ID，失败返回错误信息。`,\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`创建 Jira 工单。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">使用场景：用户明确要求创建任务、Bug 或需求时调用。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">不要在用户只是讨论问题时调用。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">成功返回工单 ID，失败返回错误信息。`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span></code></pre></div><p>参数层面同样要写清约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>标题限长</li>\n<li><code>type</code>/<code>priority</code> 用 enum 并附中文释义（如 Critical 用于线上故障）</li>\n<li>可选参数说明默认行为（如 assignee 留空由项目负责人分配）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"四条关键原则\">四条关键原则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>写明何时调用</td>\n<td>描述触发场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写明何时不调用</td>\n<td>排除易混淆场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>枚举值附释义</td>\n<td>每个 enum 值给出中文含义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>说明默认与返回</td>\n<td>可选参数的默认行为、返回格式与错误情况</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多轮工具调用循环\">多轮工具调用循环</h2><ul>\n<li>复杂任务通常需要多轮工具调用</li>\n<li>LLM 根据前一轮工具的返回结果决定下一步操作</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"健壮循环的三要素\">健壮循环的三要素</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[LLM 响应]--&gt;B{要调工具?}&#10;    B--&gt;|否|C[返回答案]&#10;    B--&gt;|是|D[执行工具]&#10;    D--&gt;E[结果入消息历史]&#10;    E--&gt;F{超过轮次?}&#10;    F--&gt;|否|A&#10;    F--&gt;|是|G[终止]\">flowchart TD\n    A[LLM 响应]--&gt;B{要调工具?}\n    B--&gt;|否|C[返回答案]\n    B--&gt;|是|D[执行工具]\n    D--&gt;E[结果入消息历史]\n    E--&gt;F{超过轮次?}\n    F--&gt;|否|A\n    F--&gt;|是|G[终止]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最大轮次限制</td>\n<td>防止无限循环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误恢复</td>\n<td>工具执行失败时把错误信息回传给 LLM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文管理</td>\n<td>持续把调用与结果追加进消息历史</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"实现骨架\">实现骨架</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"for (let i = 0; i &lt; maxIter; i++) {&#10;  const c = await nextChoice();&#10;  messages.push(c.message);&#10;  if (!wantsTools(c)) {&#10;    return c.message.content;&#10;  }&#10;  const results = await runAll(c);&#10;  messages.push(...results);&#10;}&#10;return &#39;达到最大迭代次数限制&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxIter; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> nextChoice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  messages.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c.message);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wantsTools</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.message.content;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> runAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  messages.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">results);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '达到最大迭代次数限制'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Function Calling 是 LLM 与外部系统的标准化接口，实现了「意图-执行分离」</li>\n<li>OpenAI 和 Anthropic 的接口设计理念相同但实现细节不同，跨模型系统需要适配层</li>\n<li>函数描述的质量直接决定调用准确性，应包含调用时机、参数释义和返回值说明</li>\n<li>并行 Function Calling 显著减少多工具场景的交互轮次</li>\n<li>多轮工具循环需要设置最大迭代、错误处理和上下文管理机制</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Function Calling 机制","id":"function-calling-机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"意图-执行分离","id":"意图-执行分离"},{"level":3,"text":"各家提供商能力对比","id":"各家提供商能力对比"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenAI Function Calling 实现","id":"openai-function-calling-实现"},{"level":3,"text":"函数定义","id":"函数定义"},{"level":3,"text":"调用-反馈循环","id":"调用-反馈循环"},{"level":3,"text":"并行调用","id":"并行调用"},{"level":2,"text":"Anthropic Tool Use 对比","id":"anthropic-tool-use-对比"},{"level":3,"text":"接口形态","id":"接口形态"},{"level":3,"text":"五个关键差异","id":"五个关键差异"},{"level":2,"text":"函数描述优化","id":"函数描述优化"},{"level":3,"text":"高质量描述示例","id":"高质量描述示例"},{"level":3,"text":"四条关键原则","id":"四条关键原则"},{"level":2,"text":"多轮工具调用循环","id":"多轮工具调用循环"},{"level":3,"text":"健壮循环的三要素","id":"健壮循环的三要素"},{"level":3,"text":"实现骨架","id":"实现骨架"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多代理协作模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/multi-agent-frameworks/multi-agent-patterns"},"next":{"title":"MCP 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/tool-integration/mcp-protocol"}}